OL,3,GNEWSAHealth assessment delays leaving
OL,4,Apeople 'forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foodbank manager in Brighton says
OL,7,Fdelays in health assessment decisions
OL,8,Fhas left people struggling with their
OL,9,Fmental health and falling into debt.
OL,11,FLaurel Nathan said she knew more than a
OL,12,Fdozen people who were entitled to
OL,13,Fdouble the standard universal credit
OL,14,Fpayments they are receiving because of
OL,15,Fdisability or health conditions.
OL,17,FIn June, 350,000 people across the UK
OL,18,Fwere waiting for a work capability
OL,19,Fassessment decision - up 23% on the
OL,20,Fprevious year - according to figures
OL,21,Ffrom the Department for Work and
OL,22,FPensions (DWP).
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
